WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.087
- I would say in, like,
the pantheon of Super Bowls

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:06.715
Steelers-Cardinals was, like,
one of the greatest

00:00:06.715 --> 00:00:08.508
most exciting games I've ever seen.
- Super Bowl 43, yeah.

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:10.343
- You ended that Super Bowl.

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:12.846
So, like, take me through
the play, man.

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:14.389
Like, that s--t was nuts.

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:15.974
- You know, it was, like,
we had a timeout before

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:17.559
and I remember Coach Tomlin
pullin' us out, like

00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:19.394
"Woo, we need a big play."

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:21.271
You know, that's the kinda
s--t you see on TV, in a movie.

00:00:21.271 --> 00:00:23.398
Like, "Come on, man,
we need a big play from you."

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:25.567
Like, man, I ain't finna make
no big play.

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:28.361
Like, "All right, Coach,
you know I got you."

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:29.738
You know, they got
Larry Fitzgerald

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:31.656
tallest receiver out there
at the time.

00:00:31.656 --> 00:00:33.074
Kurt Warner can throw the ball.

00:00:33.074 --> 00:00:34.534
- Yeah.
- So the best thing to do

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:36.202
is to stop the ball,
like in basketball.

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:37.787
Stop the guy with the ball.

00:00:37.787 --> 00:00:40.874
So I'm rushin',
and Kurt Warner's lookin' at me

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:45.045
so as I went out,
he dipped in, so I dipped out

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:47.255
and I seen Kurt reaching back,
and I just kinda like—

00:00:47.255 --> 00:00:48.840
- Superman.
- Supermanned it.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.550
- Yeah.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:53.511
- Hit the ball out,
sack, forced fumble.

00:00:53.511 --> 00:00:55.221
Brett Keisel jumped on the ball.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:56.514
- There's probably two moments

00:00:56.514 --> 00:00:58.183
where the crowd goes nuts, right?

00:00:58.183 --> 00:00:59.934
One when you smack it out

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:02.645
and then, like,
the realization afterwards.

00:01:02.645 --> 00:01:05.148
- You know what?
It didn't feel real at first.

00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:07.358
Going into that game, we felt
like we was gonna win anyways

00:01:07.358 --> 00:01:09.277
so I already had my camera
on the sideline.

00:01:09.277 --> 00:01:10.904
- What do you mean,
you brought a camera down?

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:12.572
- After halftime,
I snuck it on the field.

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:15.033
- You snuck it on your jersey?
- I snuck it on the field.

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:16.367
- So were you doing, like,
selfies?

00:01:16.367 --> 00:01:17.994
- Hell yeah.
I was recording myself.

00:01:17.994 --> 00:01:20.205
And I remember Brett Keisel
asking me, said

00:01:20.205 --> 00:01:22.040
"LaMarr, man,
you want the football?"

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:24.542
I said, "Nah, man, keep it."
Why in the hell did I say that?

00:01:24.542 --> 00:01:25.835
- Yeah, what were you thinking?

00:01:25.835 --> 00:01:28.338
- He caught me
at an exciting time.

00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:30.590
- Bein' a good teammate.
- Yeah.

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:31.758
And to this day,
I'm still tryin'

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:33.510
to get that damn ball back.

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:35.303
If I ever go to his house,
I'm takin' the ball.

00:01:35.303 --> 00:01:36.596
- You gonna steal it?
- Yeah, I'm gonna steal it.

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:38.014
- Brett, Brett,
hide the ball, man.

00:01:38.014 --> 00:01:41.142
- I'm stealin' that, for real.
- [Laughing]

00:01:41.142 --> 00:01:41.643
- When the Eagles beat the Bears,
I was so excited

